			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed players with legacy 64x32 skins, such as Notch, rendering with a solid black hat layer (#5). Alphaskins was blocking vanilla's cleanup of fully opaque hat layers on old-format skins. Skins that use transparency are unaffected.\n\nThis fix is included in every supported version: 1.21.4, 1.21.8, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3 on Fabric and NeoForge.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mja00/alphaskins/compare/v5.2.0...v5.2.1"
		},
